olygon><polygon points=\"292.12,171.88 289.48,173.32 289.48,119.32 292.12,117.88\" fill=\"#304f40\" stroke=\"#829170\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></polygon><polygon points=\"255.6,97.96000000000001 292.12,117.88 289.48,119.32 252.96,99.39999999999998\" fill=\"#6d8061\" stroke=\"#829170\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></polygon><text x=\"282\" y=\"91\" fill=\"#ede0b6\" font-family=\"system-ui\" font-size=\"9\" letter-spacing=\"1\">YARD / 0 m</text><text x=\"486.6\" y=\"145.36\" fill=\"#ede0b6\" font-family=\"system-ui\" font-size=\"9\" letter-spacing=\"1\">DECK / 2.12 m</text><ellipse cx=\"283.8509570401788\" cy=\"187.55026333073343\" rx=\"8\" ry=\"4\" fill=\"#09261f88\"></ellipse><path d=\"M283.8509570401788 186.55026333073343v-23\" stroke=\"#f1d392\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"283.8509570401788\" cy=\"157.55026333073343\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f4dfb1\"></circle><text x=\"295.8509570401788\" y=\"162.55026333073343\" fill=\"#fff0c8\" font-family=\"system-ui\" font-size=\"10\">YOU</text></svg><div class=\"scene-legend\"><span>● You</span><span>— Stair route</span><span id=\"location\">Between landings · 0.05 m</span></div><p id=\"status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Walking the stair route.</p><div class=\"movement\" aria-label=\"Walk controls\"><button data-walk=\"0,-1\" aria-label=\"Walk north\" disabled=\"\">↑</button><button data-walk=\"-1,0\" aria-label=\"Walk west\" disabled=\"\">←</button><button data-walk=\"0,1\" aria-label=\"Walk south\" disabled=\"\">↓</button><button data-walk=\"1,0\" aria-label=\"Walk east\" disabled=\"\">→</button><span>Arrow keys while the yard has focus.<br>Each press walks half a metre.</span></div></section>\n<aside><section class=\"interaction-card\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">THE GATE</p><h2 id=\"gate-state\">Open</h2><button id=\"door-action\" disabled=\"\">Close yard gate</button><button id=\"unlock\" hidden=\"\" disabled=\"\">Unlock yard gate</button><p id=\"door-reason\" class=\"hint\">Finish the current stair route before using another interaction.</p></section>\n<section class=\"interaction-card\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">THE STAIRS</p><h2 id=\"stair-state\">On the stairs</h2><button id=\"stairs\" disabled=\"\">Take deck stairs</button><p id=\"stairs-reason\" class=\"hint\">Following the stair route. Save here to resume mid-flight.</p><progress id=\"travel\" max=\"1\" value=\"0.09800246081760917\" aria-label=\"Stair progress\"></progress><div class=\"inline-actions\"><button id=\"pause\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Pause walk</button><button id=\"step\">Walk 0.25 s</button></div></section>\n<section class=\"save-card\"><div class=\"inline-actions\"><button id=\"save\">Save progress</button><button id=\"restore\">Restore</button></div><details><summary>Portable save</summary><label for=\"save-json\">Complete yard checkpoint</label><textarea id=\"save-json\" rows=\"5\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea><div class=\"inline-actions\"><button id=\"export\">Export to text</button><button id=\"import\">Import text</button></div></details></section></aside></div>\n<details class=\"test-controls\"><summary>Try the interaction rules</summary><p>These controls change the practice scenario.</p><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"block-door\"> Someone is standing in the doorway</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"have-key\" checked=\"\"> Carry the yard key</label><button id=\"lock\" disabled=\"\">Lock closed gate</button></details>\n<ol id=\"events\" aria-label=\"Recent committed actions\"><li>stairs started · deck-stairs</li><li>door opened · yard-gate</li></ol></section>\n<section class=\"handoff\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">TAKE IT INTO YOUR GAME</p><h2>Shared behavior. Your world.</h2><p>The title flow, door rules and stair travel are reusable modules. The yard supplies the world, player, clock and save adapter.</p></div><div class=\"handoff-links\"><a href=\"../docs/standard-interactions.md\">Door &amp; stair bindings <span>Scale, collision, keys, saves and limits ↗</span></a><a href=\"../docs/game-title.md\">Title screen recipe <span>Identity, input, loading, settings and credits ↗</span></a><a href=\"../docs/asset-handoffs.md\">Asset handoff guide <span>What the next game team needs to know ↗</span></a></div></section></main>\n<dialog id=\"settings\" class=\"settings-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"settings-title\"><form id=\"settings-form\"><h2 id=\"settings-title\">Settings</h2><label><input id=\"auto-walk\" type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"> Automatically walk stair routes</label><p>Turn this off to advance the route with “Walk 0.25 s”.</p><div class=\"inline-actions\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"settings-cancel\">Cancel</button><button type=\"submit\">Apply</button></div></form></dialog>\n<footer>Original Nautilus reference consumer · no game pins or live releases are changed.</footer><script type=\"module\" src=\"./game-starter.js\"></script></body>"
